Shopping in Beijing? Save up to 50% on selected products!

Beijing's November–December trade-in campaign combines government subsidies with extra JD.com discounts on home appliances, digital devices and smart products. To claim the subsidy, search "北京国补" (Beijing National Subsidy) in the JD app or WeChat mini-program and follow the instructions to claim via UnionPay. Trade in your old devices for extra savings. #ShoppinginChina #BeijingShopping #ConsumerSubsidies #ChinaConsumption
@SpotlightBJ @BusinessBeijing

